{"status":"success","record_count":8,"v_name":"FHL和合本","version":"unv","proc":0,"record":[{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":1,"bible_text":"（大衛的<WAH09001><WH01732>詩。）我要一<WAH09002><WAH03605>心<WH03820>稱謝你<WH03034><WTH8686>，在諸神<WH0430>面前<WAH05048>歌頌你<WH02167><WTH8762>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":2,"bible_text":"我要向<WAH0413>你的聖<WH06944>殿<WH01964>下拜<WH07812><WTH8691>，為<WAH05921>你的慈愛<WH02617>和<WAH05921>誠實<WH0571>稱讚<WH03034><WTH8686>{<WAH0853>}你的名<WH08034>；因<WAH03588>你使你的話<WH0565>顯為大<WH01431><WTH8689>，過於你所應許的（或譯：超乎<WAH05921>{<WAH03605>}你的名聲<WH08034>）。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":3,"bible_text":"我呼求<WH07121><WTH8804>的日子<WAH09002><WH03117>，你就應允我<WH06030><WTH8799>，鼓勵我<WH07292><WTH8686>，使我心裡<WAH09002><WH05315>有能力<WH05797>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":4,"bible_text":"耶和華<WH03068>啊，地上<WH0776>的君王<WH04428>都<WAH03605>要稱謝你<WH03034><WTH8686>，因<WAH03588>他們聽見了<WH08085><WTH8804>你口中<WH06310>的言語<WH0561>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":5,"bible_text":"他們要歌頌<WH07891><WTH8799>耶和華<WH03068>的作為<WAH09002><WH01870>，因<WAH03588>耶和華<WH03068>大<WH01419>有榮耀<WH03519>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":6,"bible_text":"耶和華<WH03068>雖<WAH03588>高<WH07311><WTH8802>，仍看顧<WH07200><WTH8799>低微<WH08217>的人；他卻從遠處<WAH04480><WH04801>看出<WH03045><WTH8799>驕傲<WH01364>的人。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":7,"bible_text":"我雖<WAH0518>行<WH03212><WTH8799>在患難<WH06869>中<WAH09002><WH07130>，你必將我救活<WH02421><WTH8762>；我的仇敵<WH0341><WTH8802>發怒<WH0639>，你必伸<WH07971><WTH8799>手<WH03027>抵擋{<WAH05921>}他們；你的右手<WH03225>也必救我<WH03467><WTH8686>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":138,"sec":8,"bible_text":"耶和華<WH03068>必成全<WH01584><WTH8799>關乎我的事<WAH01157>；耶和華<WH03068>啊，你的慈愛<WH02617>永遠長存<WAH09001><WH05769>！求你不要<WAH0408>離棄<WH07503><WTH8686>你手<WH03027>所造的<WH04639>。"}],"prev":{"chineses":"詩","engs":"Ps","chap":137,"sec":9},"next":{"chineses":"詩","engs":"Ps","chap":139,"sec":1}}